    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "`vat` doesn't work correctly in some cases, sorry if this is a duplicate, but I didn't quite get what I have to do to get this working. The video shows the, _for me_, weird behavior\r\n\r\n- first try: the selection is what I expected\r\n- secondy try: the parent element is getting selected, not what I was expecting\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10850738/228384862-f21dc219-e55c-457c-b4d5-366e68df74a7.mov\r\n\r\n\r\nI'm using LazyVim, and I started the first discussion there\r\nhttps://github.com/LazyVim/LazyVim/discussions/500",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">vat</code> doesn't work correctly in some cases, sorry if this is a duplicate, but I didn't quite get what I have to do to get this working. The video shows the, <em>for me</em>, weird behavior</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>first try: the selection is what I expected</li>\n<li>secondy try: the parent element is getting selected, not what I was expecting</li>\n</ul>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">Screen.Recording.2023-03-29.at.00.54.39.mov</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10850738/228384862-f21dc219-e55c-457c-b4d5-366e68df74a7.mov?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..tyisH458TXh3YM5GaGHUtrB98vP8gSLoBAGFC7kr6uA\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10850738/228384862-f21dc219-e55c-457c-b4d5-366e68df74a7.mov?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..tyisH458TXh3YM5GaGHUtrB98vP8gSLoBAGFC7kr6uA\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm using LazyVim, and I started the first discussion there<br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5015023\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/LazyVim/LazyVim/discussions/500\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/LazyVim/LazyVim/discussions/500/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/LazyVim/LazyVim/discussions/500\">LazyVim/LazyVim#500</a></p>",
    "bodyText": "vat doesn't work correctly in some cases, sorry if this is a duplicate, but I didn't quite get what I have to do to get this working. The video shows the, for me, weird behavior\n\nfirst try: the selection is what I expected\nsecondy try: the parent element is getting selected, not what I was expecting\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n\n    Screen.Recording.2023-03-29.at.00.54.39.mov\n    \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n\nI'm using LazyVim, and I started the first discussion there\nLazyVim/LazyVim#500",
